  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Peel the zucchini, sweet potato and carrot and grate them."
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix the grated vegetables with all the other fritter ingredients in a large bowl and shape into tablespoon-sized fritters by hand."
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour a little olive oil into a frying pan and fry the fritters for 2 to 3 minutes on each side until golden. Cool slightly."
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut each sesame bun in half and spread both sides with mayonnaise or tahini. Add a washed and dried lettuce leaf, cucumber slices and tomato slices. Place a fritter in the middle and close the bun."
    }
  ]
